 likely mean?\",\n      \"options\": [\"the physical atmosphere\", \"the emotional mood\", \"the architectural style\", \"the historical context\"],\n      \"answer\": \"the emotional mood\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\n      \"question\": \"Which of the following statements is true according to the passage?\",\n      \"options\": [\"The MET has fewer than two million works of art.\", \"The museum was founded by a woman.\", \"The collection includes only modern paintings.\", \"The early 20th-century American arts are not part of the museum's exhibits.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"The MET has fewer than two million works of art.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
